# r552-r580 security-scan SKILL.md and references/scan-layers.md
SPLIT R:RULE-M1-0196 | a: Investigation prompts are not automatic vulnerability declarations; do not invent exploitability. | b: Rate severity by reachability, exposure and exploitability rather than mechanically by pattern, CVSS or OWASP category. | c: Avoid known false positives. | d: Mark findings with incomplete evidence as needing verification. | e: Do not claim a static scan proves design security. | f: Do not upgrade packages during a scan unless asked.
SD P:RULE-M1-0608 R:RULE-M1-0196#b | S: security finding severity M: MUST both E: none in either T: none
SD P:RULE-M1-0607 R:RULE-M1-0196#f | S: security scans M: MUST_NOT both E: asked (both) T: during a scan
